 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Lovely. A popular spot is the North York rivers. There's a trail through woods with a view of the river. Perfect. Set up a little table by the river, and a small buffet of those things, maybe some sandwiches, yoghurt and chocolate or a portable speaker. A little, but it' more about the setting. A small portable speaker and a few slow tunes makes it feel more special. That's lovely. A simple note saying the weekend is yours, and a small gift in a little box.",
